emies-icons/Crestcaller.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The most commonly seen beast in the outskirts of Houei. Herd animals that feed on bamboo. Though small and weak, they reproduce very quickly, and are depicted in even the oldest annals of Houei.","abilities":["Temporary gains Frighten when nearby enemy units die.","Gains extended Frighten when <Lord of Thunder> is on the field."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":300,"def":100,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"blazing_originium_slug":{"slug":"blazing_originium_slug","name":"Blazing Originium Slug","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blazing Originium Slug.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A wild infected creature, they spray superheated fluids at their foes, posing more of a threat than typical Originium Slugs. Abundant in environments with abnormal energy, their breeding and migration patterns remain a mystery.","abilities":["Attacks deal Burn"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":1200,"atk":50,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"shellsnap_newt":{"slug":"shellsnap_newt","name":"Shellsnap Newt","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shellsnap Newt.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Newts that dwell in the depths of the bamboo groves. Naturally timid, they carry around their own eggshells even after hatching, so that they may withdraw into them at any time.","abilities":["Curls up and stops attacking when your units are nearby, or if <Lord of Thunder> is on the field."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0